# Kind $73 (84:8766 Kind73Hit), the chain's head, beaten: its last
# bytes (84:87C0, the BRA back to its BRK for good) run only when no piece
# rewrites its resume. On the frame the head is beaten, the eighth piece
# (its $40 = 8, record $0E7B) ends the fight and starts the
# head's list on $84:89CD (ActorListStart) after the head's BRK. Played
# as the second half of cov_kind73_defeat.box (health 0 before the
# strike); 313 frames after that poke, one frame before the head is
# beaten, the eighth piece's record is freed (state 0), so the head's
# resume stays $84:87C0 and it runs its BRA the next frame.
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a5_s3.state
hold Y+RIGHT 23
hold RIGHT 13
hold LEFT 50
